{"text":"永平四年十二月十二日，清信女尹伯成妻姜爲亡夫伯成造觀世音像一軀。願使侍佛文〔聞〕法，永離三途。一切衆生，普同斯〔福〕。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"伯成","refId":null,"text":"伯成","start":15,"end":17},{"name":"PersonName","term":"伯成","refId":null,"text":"伯成","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"觀世音","refId":null,"text":"觀世音","start":25,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三途","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":49,"end":51}]}